 128:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 			/** Regulator enable option mask for \ref USB_Init(). This indicates that the internal 3.3V USB 
 129:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 			 *  regulator should be enabled to regulate the data pin voltages from the VBUS level down to a 
