 151:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 				 *  (both control and standard) when in either device or host mode. If the next packet of a str
 152:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 				 *  is not received or acknowledged within this time period, the stream function will fail.
 153:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 				 *
 154:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 				 *  This value may be overridden in the user project makefile as the value of the
 155:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 				 *  \ref USB_STREAM_TIMEOUT_MS token, and passed to the compiler using the -D switch.
