 162:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Device_AVR8.h **** 				 *  \ref EVENT_USB_Device_StartOfFrame() event to fire once per millisecond, synchronized to th
 163:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Device_AVR8.h **** 				 *  at the start of each USB frame when enumerated in device mode.
