 173:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Device_AVR8.h **** 				/** Disables the device mode Start Of Frame events. When disabled, this stops the firing of the
 174:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Device_AVR8.h **** 				 *  \ref EVENT_USB_Device_StartOfFrame() event when enumerated in device mode.
