 225:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			/** Configures the specified endpoint number with the given endpoint type, direction, bank size
 226:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			 *  and banking mode. Once configured, the endpoint may be read from or written to, depending
