 263:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			 *  \return Boolean \c true if the configuration succeeded, \c false otherwise.
 264:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			 */
